---
import { links, version, site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="section install" id="install" aria-labelledby="install-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="install-head">
      <h2 id="install-title" class="title" data-reveal>Free. Download, drag, open.</h2>
      <div class="dl" data-reveal>
        <a class="btn btn-ember btn-lg" href={links.download}>
          Download Cursorlight.dmg
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3.5v11m0 0 4.5-4.5M10 14.5 5.5 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
        <p class="fine">Version {version}. macOS {site.minimumMacOS} or later. Apple silicon and Intel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li data-reveal>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Drag it to Applications.</h3>
          <p>Open the disk image and drag Cursorlight onto the Applications folder.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li data-reveal>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Confirm the first launch.</h3>
          <p>
            Cursorlight is not notarized yet, because there is no Apple Developer account behind it. macOS will refuse the first launch and
            say it cannot verify the app. That message is about the missing notarization, not a finding about the app. You confirm once.
          </p>
          <div class="how">
            <div>
              <h4>macOS 15 or later</h4>
              <ol>
                <li>Open Cursorlight from Applications. When the warning appears, click Done. Do not choose Move to Trash.</li>
                <li>Open System Settings, then Privacy &amp; Security, and scroll to Security.</li>
                <li>Click Open Anyway next to Cursorlight, confirm with your password or Touch ID, then click Open.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>macOS 14</h4>
              <ol>
                <li>Control-click Cursorlight in Applications and choose Open.</li>
                <li>Click Open in the dialog.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="term">
            <p>Or, if you trust the source, remove the quarantine flag in Terminal:</p>
            <div class="cmd">
              <code id="xattr-cmd">xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Cursorlight.app</code>
              <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="#xattr-cmd" aria-label="Copy the Terminal command">Copy</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li data-reveal>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Try it for real.</h3>
          <p>A short welcome makes you shake the mouse, use the laser and draw ink before it finishes. No permission is needed for any of that.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .install-head { display: grid; gap: 32px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: end; margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 7vw, 104px); }
  @media (min-width: 960px) { .install-head { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr); } .dl { justify-self: end; } }
  .dl { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .btn-lg { min-height: 64px; padding: 0 32px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .fine { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.92rem; }

  .steps { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); counter-reset: none; }
  .steps > li { display: grid; gap: 14px 28px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .steps > li { grid-template-columns: clamp(64px, 9vw, 140px) minmax(0, 1fr); } }
  .n { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem); line-height: 0.85; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: var(--ember); }
  .steps h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .steps p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 44rem; }
  .how { display: grid; gap: 28px 48px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 26px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .how { grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; } }
  .how h4 { font: 500 0.88rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .how ol { display: grid; gap: 10px; counter-reset: s; }
  .how ol li { position: relative; padding-left: 30px; color: var(--muted); counter-increment: s; }
  .how ol li::before { content: counter(s); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.12em; width: 20px; height: 20px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); font: 500 0.72rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--text); }
  .term { margin-top: 28px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .cmd { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 14px; background: var(--ink-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; max-width: 44rem; }
  .cmd code { color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .copy { appearance: none; background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--text); font: 500 0.85rem var(--font-mono); padding: 8px 14px; min-height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 200ms, background-color 200ms; }
  .copy:hover { border-color: var(--text); }
  .copy[data-copied="true"] { background: var(--ember); border-color: var(--ember); color: var(--ember-ink); }
</style>
